Summary of the Fix
 * The Problem: Your environment was still injecting "fincoredev" into the nameservice variable, causing the code to pick HA Mode.
 * The Solution: I updated HadoopConfig.java to check if (uri.startsWith("file:")). If this is true, it ignores nameservice completely. This forces the system to treat D:/reports as a local file, resolving the Wrong FS error.
